<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks</p>
<p>of ecuadorean coffee, effective from March 13-19:</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 204.85</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$ 199.61</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  67.82</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$ 159.12</p>
</text>
